MODULE pack

FUNCTION create offline pack
    require a compatible lock, a contained ZIP destination, and every locked
        digest as a verified cache object
    write schema-1 pack metadata, the complete lock, and one stored archive per
        unique digest into a temporary ZIP
    synchronize and atomically publish the ZIP, preserving an older pack in
        local trash

FUNCTION restore offline pack
    open the ZIP and index regular-file entries
    reject links, duplicate names, unexpected names, oversized metadata,
        unknown fields, duplicate JSON keys, incompatible platform metadata,
        missing archives, extra archives, wrong sizes, and wrong checksums
    import each archive through a temporary synchronized cache file
    force offline mode and install the validated packed lock

All failures close open resources and report cleanup failures with the original
error.
